            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 46,
              "start": 46
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Petitioner CSX argues that the stock\u2011and\u2011debt valuation method is unreliable and should not be used by Georgia."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Calvert",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "bc27c1219c7a7059458e5d941385c3e875ad97095f66cd3513c307675135e5fe",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-bc27c1219c7a-0001-0008"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 28,
              "start": 28
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Calvert, respondent Georgia maintains that subsection\u202f(b)(1) provides a narrow exception allowing the state to apply its chosen valuation methodology."
      }
